== Trivia ==
* The outfit's color is similar to the outfit of [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pajama_Sam Pajama Sam], a character who also wears pajamas. Wearing the {{i|Blanket}} further matches the outfit if worn together.
* This item is part of a set of bedtime-themed items, including {{i|Binky}}, {{i|Blanket}}, {{i|Mr. Dolly}}, and {{i|Night Light}}.
* Picking this item up instantly unlocks {{C|Lazarus}} if he isn't unlocked, due to PJs instantly granting the 4 required Soul Hearts.

